{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/Gifs.jpg?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RECALL NEWS is a co-op horror game for 1\u20134 players with unstable worlds, cursed objects, and light survival mechanics. Team up with friends to explore broken zones, collect strange decor, and sell it before Command loses signal \u2014 or loses patience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/1.png?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/1.gif?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>...collect clues. Walk the wrong way.</i></strong> <br>Your job is to find, extract, and sell strange decorative objects from fractured worlds. Why? You\u2019re not authorized to know. Just don\u2019t drop the vase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/2.png?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/2.gif?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>...reality won\u2019t hold for long.</i></strong> <br>Each zone is unstable. Lights flicker, rooms distort, and the voice on the radio grows less human the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/3.png?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/3.gif?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>...communication is your only weapon \u2014 and your weakest link.</i></strong> <br>Talking helps. One teammate spots a trap, another calls out a step into the void. But the deeper you go, the more voices echo on the air.<br>Not all of them belong to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/4.png?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/extras/4.gif?t=1751700055\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>RECALL NEWS is messy, haunted, and weirdly fun.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab stuff that shouldn\u2019t be touched, yell about doors that weren\u2019t there a second ago, and try to sell your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scream together. Profit together. Have fun (or perish trying).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825030?t=1751700055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825030?t=1751700055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/f74fde56144685b2d567b6f048dfd937a374c5f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751700055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825030/f74fde56144685b2d567b6f048dfd937a374c5f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751700055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":